HB0145 Absentee ballot return-required information.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Smith, S, Allemand, Angelos, Brady,
Campbell, K, Hoeft, Lucas, Pendergraft and Webb and
Senator(s) Hutchings and Ide
AN ACT relating to elections; requiring absentee ballots to contain an official
envelope inside the inner ballot envelope; requiring absentee voters to provide
identification information as specified; and providing for an effective date.
